OL,3,GNEWSA6,750 homes planned in city centre
OL,4,Aregeneration
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We want the city centre to be a
OL,7,Fthriving urban hub and destination of
OL,8,Fchoice that attracts investment,
OL,9,Fsupports businesses, celebrates
OL,10,Fcreativity, supports enterprise, and
OL,11,Fenhances quality of life for all who
OL,12,Flive, work, study and visit here," said
OL,13,FCouncillor Stephen Simkins, City of
OL,14,FWolverhampton Council leader.
